#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/transform/pass_config/index.rst:340
msgid ""
"Enable packed FP32x2 accumulation for CUDA sum and absolute-sum reductions "
"on SM100 and newer GPUs. Per-reduction annotations can still disable the "
"optimization. Setting this to False disables it globally. Default: True"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/transform/pass_config/index.rst:350
msgid "Enable lowering eligible global->shared copies to PTX `cp.async`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/transform/pass_config/index.rst:352
msgid ""
"When True (default), TileLang may lower: - `T.copy(global -> shared, ...)` "
"to `ptx_cp_async + commit + wait` - `T.async_copy(global -> shared, ...)` to "
"`ptx_cp_async + commit` (no wait) - plain user-written global->shared copy "
"stores (e.g. in `T.Parallel`) to"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/transform/pass_config/index.rst:356
msgid "`ptx_cp_async + commit + wait`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/transform/pass_config/index.rst:358
msgid ""
"Important: Automatic cp.async lowering is gated by the surrounding loop "
"context. TileLang will only auto-enable cp.async when the copy is observed "
"inside a software-pipelined loop annotated with `num_stages > 0` (e.g. "
"created by `T.Pipelined(..., num_stages=...)` or by pipeline planning). "
"Outside such loops, TileLang will prefer synchronous copy lowering even when "
"this flag is True. You can request local cp.async injection on a specific "
"parallel loop via `T.Parallel(..., prefer_async=True)`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/transform/pass_config/index.rst:367
msgid ""
"When False, TileLang will avoid the cp.async lowering path for `T.copy`. "
"Explicit `T.async_copy` still requires cp.async support and may error if it "
"cannot be lowered."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/transform/pass_config/index.rst:371
msgid "Default: True"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/transform/pass_config/index.rst:378
msgid ""
"Enable non-predicated LDG/STG lowering for global memory access. When "
"enabled, converts Ramp-based global buffer load/store to ldg/stg intrinsics. "
"Default: False"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/transform/pass_config/index.rst:387
msgid ""
"Enable predicated LDG/STG lowering. When True, predicated loads "
"(if_then_else with else=0) and predicated stores (IfThenElse with empty then "
"case) are lowered to ldg/stg intrinsics. Default: False"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/transform/pass_config/index.rst:397
msgid ""
"Enable verbose output for vectorize planner. When enabled, prints detailed "
"information about each buffer's inferred vector size and which buffer "
"determines the final vectorization factor. Useful for debugging "
"vectorization issues. Default: False"
msgstr ""

